

Backup & Restore:
``````````````````
Archive 
- tar 		[.tar]
- gunzip	[.gz]

tar + gunzip: .tgz

Syntax:
tar -attrib <new_backupfile>.tgz <orig_data_path>

Create:
```````
tar -czvf backup.tgz /etc

-c : create
-z : gunzip 
-v : verbose
-f : Forcefully


View:
``````
tar -tzvf backup.tgz

-t: Tree view

Restore/extract:
`````````````````
tar -xzvf backup.tgz [ extract in CWD ]
tar -xzvf backup.tgz -C ooo/

-C : create backup and path (where you want to extract) 
